      "san_match": true,
      "human_comment": "",
      "human_symbol": null,
      "system_comment": "Black's most accurate reply, yet White keeps a slight advantage (+0.27, Stockfish:16) after [pv:Kg8 Qc4 Rxe2+ Qxe2 Nxe2]. Black's pawn structure is now weaker, with doubled, isolated, and backward pawns that are often awkward to advance and defend\u2014a lasting burden White can keep probing as the line unfolds. In return for accepting that structural weakness, this is still the best Black can do in the position.",
