    {
      "ply": 43,
      "san": "Nf7+",
      "human_san": "Nf7+",
      "san_match": true,
      "human_comment": "Flohr: \"I was in\nsevere zeitnot - only two minutes to the time control - and repeating moves\nhad helped me saving time. My opponent proposed a draw. I thanked him but\ndeclined the proposal, because, in the mean time, I had found a good plan of\nattack (I had calculated variations up to the 29th move).\" My friends, here is\na \"tough\" chessplayer! Indeed he was, for sure! How many of us, with only two\nminutes left to play to the 40th move or give checkmate would have declined\nthe proposal?",
      "human_symbol": null,
      "system_comment": "Nf7+ is the strongest continuation, maintaining White's advantage (+0.32, Stockfish:16) along [pv:Nf7+ Kg8 Qc4 Rxe2+ Qxe2], a forcing line that may leave Black's pieces passive\u2014when pieces lack good squares, counterplay dries up. Bxd4 was a comparable option, leading to equality with [pv:Bxd4] by winning a piece and making the king safe at once, yet Nf7+ preserves the clearer edge.",
      "system_symbol": "!",
      "is_key_moment": true,
      "final_comment": true,
      "both_present": true,
      "human_only": false,
      "system_only": false,
      "neither": false,
      "text_ratio": 0.016,
