      "san_match": true,
      "human_comment": "",
      "human_symbol": null,
      "system_comment": "Black's 32...axb5 gives White a winning advantage (+2.93, Stockfish:16), as shown by [pv:axb5 Nh6+ Kh8 Nf7+ Kg8]. At the cost of this capture, White immediately obtains a passed pawn on b5\u2014a pawn that can advance without blockers and often proves decisive in the endgame. The comparable option 32...h6 is roughly as good, also giving White a winning advantage with [pv:h6 Nd8+ Kh7 Nxb7 axb5], but would have kept Black's king safer right away.",
